        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Cal-Royal 45-SVR, Crossbar Narrow Stile Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis crossbar bar style surface vertical rod panic device for narrow stiles is the perfect choice for double doors without mullions, doors with glass and doors that are not flat. Suitable for most narrow stile doors and certified grade 1 for durability.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese vertical rod exit devices are <b>non-handed, reversible for right or left hand doors up to 36\" wide and 7 feet tall.</b> The 33-7/16\" long, 15/32\" diameter round cross bar can be field sized to accommodate narrow doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nFor wider doors use <a href=\"/products/wide-door-crash-bar-vertical-rod-door-exit-device-global-ed-vr331-48\"><b>ED-VR331-48 Wide Door Crash Bar</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p><b>Specifications:</b> for CAL-45-SVR\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 34-19/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Case: 8-55/64\" x 1-17/32\" x 2-13/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case: 4-11/16\" x 1-1/16\" x 1-47/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Rod: 34-27/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Rod: 33-35/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Rod: 15/32\" Diameter </li>\r\n<li>Strikes: Top and Bottom Strikes, Handicap Bottom strike</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Material: 1\" diameter round aluminum cross bar, stainless steel rod guides and latch bolts, steel chassis with aluminum cover</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Aluminum and Dark Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Projection: Neutral 5-13/64\", Depressed 4-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 1-3/4\" minimum for single or double door application</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non Handed (Reversible for Left or Right Hand Doors) </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: Up to 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: 7' standard. Add optional 12\" or  24\" extensions for taller doors.</li>\r\n<li>Crossbar Height to Finished Floor: 41\" at Center</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with wood and machine screws.  Thru bolts included on fire rated devices.</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Dogging: Allen Key standard on non-fire rated devices</li>\r\n<li>UL and ULC Listed</li>\r\n<li>A156.3 Grade 1</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAL-45-SVR-Installation.pdf?v=1774586076\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Exterior Trim:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-entry-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-00-1278517\">Keyed Entry Lever</a>: Rigid Entrance, key locks or unlocks escutcheon trim.  ANSI Function (08).  Operates as Classroom Function.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-05-1278246\">Keyed Storeroom Lever</a>: Rigid Storeroom, key unlocks lever, lever retracts latch bolt, otherwise always locked.  ANSI Function (09)</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-passage-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-30-1278526\">Passage Lever</a>: Trim always operable and unlocked.  ANSI Function (14)</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-dummy-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-40-1278619\">Dummy Lever</a>: Dummy Escutcheon Trim.  ANSI Function (02).  </li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
